      {%- endif -%}
    {%- when 'mommy-and-me-easter-dresses', 'easter-matching-outfits', 'spring-matching-outfits' -%}
      <h2>Mommy and me Easter dresses and spring matching outfits for special occasions</h2>
      <p>This page is built for Easter and spring-intent searches where the shopper already knows the occasion. The focus is on pastel palettes, florals, lighter fabrics, and photo-ready silhouettes that work for church, brunch, egg hunts, family portraits, and other seasonal celebrations.</p>
      <h3>Best spring moments for matching outfits</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Easter Sunday, church, brunch, and family gatherings.</li>
        <li>Spring family photos, garden parties, and Mother's Day season.</li>
        <li>Travel, showers, and warm-weather events that still need a polished look.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>How to use this seasonal page</h3>
      <p>Start with Easter dresses if you need a specific event outfit, then use the same collection to find spring matching outfits that can work again after the holiday.</p>
      {%- if collections['mommy-and-me'] != blank -%}
        <p><a href="{{ collections['mommy-and-me'].url }}">Browse the full Mommy and Me collection</a> if you want more year-round matching styles outside the Easter and spring window.</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if collections['dresses'] != blank -%}
        <p><a href="{{ collections['dresses'].url }}">Shop matching dresses</a> for a broader dress-focused edit beyond seasonal spring styling.</p>
      {%- endif -%}
  {%- endcase -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- case field -%}
  {%- when 'rich_content' -%}
    {{- generated_rich_content | strip -}}
{%- endcase -%}
